      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.9,
      "end_seconds": 6.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "hello, uh, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.35,
      "end_seconds": 10.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "alright what's been worrying you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.08,
      "end_seconds": 30.84,
      "duration_seconds": 17.76,
      "text": "honestly, it's a red itchy lump on my arm, and my family pushed me to come. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it. My neighbour said I should get it looked at"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.32,
      "end_seconds": 35.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.35,
      "end_seconds": 40.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "oh uh it's been three weeks now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.54,
      "end_seconds": 51.98,
      "duration_seconds": 10.44,
      "text": "So tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets how often and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.53,
      "end_seconds": 64.63,
      "duration_seconds": 11.1,
      "text": "it happens a few times a day. It settles a little with ice. Hmm, I've had mild swelling too, for four weeks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.99,
      "end_seconds": 72.44,
      "duration_seconds": 6.45,
      "text": "before we go further, any allergies? These questions might sound routine, but they matter"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.56,
      "end_seconds": 76.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "not to to my knowledge no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.32,
      "end_seconds": 92.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.2,
      "end_seconds": 103.25,
      "duration_seconds": 10.05,
      "text": "I swim twice a week. I look after my grandchildren most days. I live with my elderly mother"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.98,
      "end_seconds": 106.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "any regular medication, tablets or creams?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.3,
      "end_seconds": 110.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "nothing regular, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.25,
      "end_seconds": 129.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.86,
      "end_seconds": 133.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "No, nothing I can think of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.65,
      "end_seconds": 137.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "have you noticed breathing trouble, fever or dizziness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.86,
      "end_seconds": 146.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Actually, no, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.8,
      "end_seconds": 152.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "anything with your nerves like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.44,
      "end_seconds": 159.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "No weakness or anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.08,
      "end_seconds": 164.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "Any muscle or joint problems besides this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.74,
      "end_seconds": 169.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "I move fine otherwise."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.07,
      "end_seconds": 191.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "let me get the readings out of the way"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.69,
      "end_seconds": 203.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.21,
      "end_seconds": 229.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.83,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 123 over 70, respiratory rate 14, heart rate 76."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 230.39,
      "end_seconds": 232.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "is that that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.53,
      "end_seconds": 238.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "don't worry, we'll discuss it in a second"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.11,
      "end_seconds": 245.46,
      "duration_seconds": 5.35,
      "text": "I'd like to to check you over now if that's alright"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.29,
      "end_seconds": 248.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "Okay nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.2,
      "end_seconds": 273.18,
      "duration_seconds": 8.98,
      "text": "there is a small red lump with a central punctum and a little swelling around it it and no spreading redness"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.48,
      "end_seconds": 277.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "All finished, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.33,
      "end_seconds": 321.01,
      "duration_seconds": 28.68,
      "text": "okay, thinking it through, this looks most like a local insect bite reaction the reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together let's use hydrocortisone cream, 1%, twice a day, five days that should help with bite reaction cool it with ice and avoid scratching do get help quickly if the redness spreads or you feel unwell"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 322.43,
      "end_seconds": 324.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "Yes, will do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.77,
      "end_seconds": 332.59,
      "duration_seconds": 6.82,
      "text": "let's plan a check if the redness spreads anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 334.13,
      "end_seconds": 337.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "okay, that makes sense thanks for explaining"
    }
  ]
